      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Petition under Article 226 of the Constitution of India is filed praying that  in the circumstances stated in the affidavit filed therewith, the High Court may  be pleased to pass an order or writ or direction, more preferably one in the  nature of a writ of mandamus declaring the action of the respondents  especially respondent no.2 to 5 in demolishing dwelling houses of petitioners  in Sy.No.180 of Apparaopeta Village, Akividu Maandal, West Godavari District without due process of law even without notice as illegal, arbitrary,\nunconstitutional, violative of principles of natural justice, contrary to the provisions of the Right to fair Compensation and transparency in Land acquisition.",
